do the phases genuinely contradict each other?
   keyed vs open  : events differ on  11.7% of steps
   keyed vs trap  : events differ on  35.6% of steps
    open vs trap  : events differ on  36.3% of steps

  good, 11.7% at worst

life: keyed -> open -> trap, 6000 steps each
same total replay, spent in different shapes:
  continuous   consolidate every 5 items while living
  micro        live 25 items, then 5 consolidations with no input
  small        live 100 items, then 20 consolidations with no input
  nap          live 500 items, then 100 consolidations with no input
  sleep        live 2000 items, then 400 consolidations with no input

  seed 0 done
  seed 1 done
  seed 2 done
  seed 3 done
  seed 4 done
  seed 5 done
  seed 6 done
  seed 7 done

