============================================================================================
DOES SLEEPING HELP? contested events, 'keyed'
============================================================================================
          arm    score   vs continuous   awake between
   continuous    64.7%                               5
        micro    65.3%           +0.6              25
        small    66.6%           +1.9             100
          nap    71.7%           +7.0             500
        sleep    73.6%           +8.9            2000

  SLEEPING WINS: sleep beat continuous by 8.9 points on the same replay
  budget. Consolidation works better when the live stream is not competing
  for the weights, which is an argument for building an offline phase into
  the system rather than interleaving it.

  One world, 8 seeds, matched replay budget. A result about schedule,
  not about sleep in general.

